</div>
    					    				        				</div>

    				    					<div class="story-box">
            <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260514ftix7v" class="title" >Gavina Earns First Team All-Conference Honors at Shortstop</a>
    
		
	
			<time datetime="2026-05-14T12:00" class="date">
					May 14, 2026
						</time>
	
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">After a standout sophomore campaign, Greyhound shortstop Kade Gavina has officially been recognized as one of the top players in the conference, earning First Team All-Conference honors following an impressive all-around season both offensively and defensively.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
			    		
    			
    			
    			
    			
    			
    		    
    			    			
    			
    			    			    			<div class="seat seat2 article">

    				    				<div class="media-box">
    				    							<div class="slide-img" data-url="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260514feb964" >
					
            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/sports/bsb/2025-26/2nd_team_website.jpg?max_width=1172&useS3=true" alt="Three Greyhounds Earn All-Conference Second Team Honors" width="1172" height="660" />
    
</div>
    					    				        				</div>

    				    					<div class="story-box">
            <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260514feb964" class="title" >Three Greyhounds Earn All-Conference Second Team Honors</a>
    
		
	
			<time datetime="2026-05-14T12:00" class="date">
					May 14, 2026
						</time>
	
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">The Greyhound baseball program is proud to recognize three standout student-athletes who have earned All-Conference Second Team honors following exceptional performances this season: Zadin Cannon (3B), Rowan Christensen (C), and Ethan Hampton (DH). Each player played a pivotal role in the Greyhounds&rsquo; success, delivering impact performances at the plate and in the field throughout the year.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
			    		
    			
    			
    			
    			
    			
    		    
    			    			
    			
    			    			    			<div class="seat seat3 article">

    				    				<div class="media-box">
    				    							<div class="slide-img" data-url="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260514ewbgw8" >
					
            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/sports/bsb/2025-26/HM_website.jpg?max_width=1172&useS3=true" alt="Greyhounds Land Four Players on All-Conference Honorable Mention Team" width="1172" height="660" />
    
</div>
    					    				        				</div>

    				    					<div class="story-box">
            <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260514ewbgw8" class="title" >Greyhounds Land Four Players on All-Conference Honorable Mention Team</a>
    
		
	
			<time datetime="2026-05-14T12:00" class="date">
					May 14, 2026
						</time>
	
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">The Greyhounds continued to make their mark in conference play this season, earning four All-Conference Honorable Mention selections following a strong 2026 campaign. Alex Downing, Max Erdley, Drew Nash, and Cale Ortner were each recognized for their contributions on the field after helping lead the Greyhounds throughout the spring.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
			    		
    			
    			
    			
    			
    			
    		    
    			    			
    			
