            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/sports/bsb/2025-26/Izac_Thompson.png?max_width=1172&useS3=true" alt="Izac Thompson &ndash; Fort Scott (NJCAA Division 1 Baseball Pitcher of the Week)" width="1172" height="660" />
    
</div>
    					    				        				</div>

    				    					<div class="story-box">
            <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260218lu587t" class="title" >Izac Thompson &ndash; Fort Scott (NJCAA Division 1 Baseball Pitcher of the Week)</a>
    
		
	
			<time datetime="2026-02-18T12:00" class="date">
					February 18, 2026
						</time>
	
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">Tossing five-innings of no-hit ball to earn his second win of the season on the mound, Fort Scott Community College pitcher Izac Thompson has been named the NJCAA Division 1 Baseball Pitcher of the Week to become the first Kansas Jayhawk Community College Conference athlete to earn the award in 2026.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
